        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o\",\n  \"response_format\": { \"type\": \"json_object\" },\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"You are the content engine for Nexalead (nexalead.ai). OFFER: Fractional Chief AI Officer for $10M-$200M revenue companies that need AI leadership without hiring a full-time executive. We bring a backend team, AI workflow design, systems consulting, and \\u2014 critically \\u2014 execution, not just strategy. CONCRETE PROMISES: board-ready AI roadmap in 14 days. Three production AI systems live in 45 days. The client owns everything we build \\u2014 code, systems, documentation. No vendor lock-in, no rented seats. PROOF: currently working with Forbes-list retailers, mid-market manufacturers, distributors and brokers across the US and LATAM. ECONOMICS: we are both a money-maker and a money-saver \\u2014 new revenue from AI systems, plus cost removed from manual operations. AUDIENCE: CEO, COO, CFO or board member at a $10M-$200M company. Non-technical. Under pressure to 'do something about AI'. Has been pitched by consultancies that deliver slide decks and disappear. VOICE: direct, concrete numbers, zero jargon, zero hype, slightly contrarian. Never say 'leverage', 'unlock', 'transform', 'journey', 'landscape', 'game-changer', or 'in today's fast-paced world'. Write like an operator talking to another operator. Respond with ONLY a JSON object.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Generate content for: {{ $json.content_brief }}\\n\\nCampaign: {{ $json.campaign_type }}\\nPlatforms: {{ $json.platforms }}\\n\\nReturn JSON with ALL these keys (empty string for unused platforms):\\n\\n- copy_facebook: conversational English for SMB owner audience, 2-3 paragraphs, plain talk\\n- copy_threads: max 500 chars, conversational take\\n- copy_bluesky: max 300 chars\\n- copy_truthsocial: max 500 chars, business/economy angle\\n- copy_mastodon: max 500 chars, include nexalead.ai link\\n- copy_telegram: up to 4096 chars, HTML formatting (<b>, <i>, <a href>), actionable AI tip format\\n- copy_tumblr: creative long-form take\\n- copy_reddit_title: genuinely useful, NOT salesy, no company name in title\\n- copy_reddit: 200-300 word value-first answer sharing a real tactic with numbers; one soft mention of nexalead.ai at the very end only\\n- copy_blogger_title: SEO headline English\\n- copy_blogger: 1000-1500 word HTML article with H2 subheadings, 2+ links to nexalead.ai\\n- blog_labels: comma separated tags\\n- copy_medium_title: compelling headline\\n- copy_medium: 800-1200 word markdown article, case-study style with numbers, 2+ links to nexalead.ai\\n- copy_substack_title: newsletter subject line\\n- copy_substack_body: 600-800 word newsletter in markdown, one actionable AI automation idea per issue\\n- copy_devto_title: technical-curious headline\\n- copy_devto: 800-1200 word markdown article, practical automation walkthrough angle, links to nexalead.ai\\n- devto_tags: 4 comma-separated tags like ai,automation,business,productivity\\n- copy_hashnode_title: SEO headline\\n- copy_hashnode: 800-1200 word markdown, DIFFERENT angle than devto and medium\\n\\nCRITICAL: Each blog (blogger, medium, substack, devto, hashnode) MUST have a DIFFERENT angle on the topic. Never duplicate content across platforms.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
